// Use the shared block +cache without defining it in the diagram
architecture Read through a cache

box app as App [note: reads a user, icon: app]
+cache c as Cache [note: keeps recent reads]
box db as Database [note: keeps every user, icon: db]

step Look up
  say The app asks the cache for the user first.
  app -> c: get user

step Load on a miss
  say The cache does not have the user, so it loads the user from the database and keeps a copy.
  c -> db: load user
